%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/components/chat-input/chat-input.component.ts::openTimingDialog；src/pages/message-v3/components/confirm-window/create-timing-message/create-timing-message.component.ts::verification；src/pages/message-v3/service/messageContainerShared.service.ts::createScheduleMessage
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant PS as Pending or local state
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员写好消息后选「定时发送」并选时间，输入框上方出现待发提示条，到点后消息自动发出
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=partial；helix=full；dual=no；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: createSchedule(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_create_schedule", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_create_schedule", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_create_schedule", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 设定未来某时刻自动发送 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/createSchedule
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction schedule + channel + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（channelScheduleCreated，UPDATE_CHANNEL）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ raw event → Angular projection
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：实现侧存下整条待发对象（message / type / props / schedulePostAt），可被 MV3-G04d 读回；channel.hasSchedulePost === true，输入框上方出现待发提示条；channel.lastPost / lastPostAt 保持不变（hasSchedulePost 是独立字段，不参与排序）；定时未到时接收者侧 events 为空、无任何状态变化（persona-local，不传播）
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：定时未到不得产生 postReceived（待发消息不进时间线）；不得更新 channel.lastPost / lastPostAt / unreadCount（待发消息不参与会话摘要与未读，语义只由 hasSchedulePost 承载）；Mock 无定时器：不得据「创建成功」断言到点会发出（该断言必须标 target，helix 接入后才成立）
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：channelScheduleCreated，UPDATE_CHANNEL；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
